          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored in Keychain. Without a saved key, Vara falls back to %@ from the environment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gemmes i nøgleringen. Uden en gemt nøgle falder Vara tilbage til %@ fra miljøet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streaming — fastest": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Streaming — hurtigst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Symbol": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Symbol"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text processing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tekstbehandling"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine turns voice into text. You can switch any time in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Motoren omdanner tale til tekst. Du kan skifte når som helst i Indstillinger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine turns your voice into raw text. Hviske runs entirely on this Mac (CC BY-NC 4.0 — non-commercial use only).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Motoren omdanner din stemme til rå tekst. Hviske kører udelukkende på denne Mac (CC BY-NC 4.0 — kun ikke-kommerciel brug)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone is only used while you hold the dictation key. Nothing is recorded in the background.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mikrofonen bruges kun, mens du holder dikteringstasten nede. Intet optages i baggrunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript is sent as the user message; these instructions steer what comes back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transskriptionen sendes som brugerbesked; disse instruktioner styrer, hvad der kommer tilbage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This week": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Denne uge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time saved": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tid sparet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: press 1–9 while dictating to use another mode for that dictation only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tip: tryk 1–9 under diktering for at bruge en anden tilstand til netop dén diktering."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I dag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try it": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prøv det"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns spoken intent into a precise prompt for a coding agent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Omdanner talte intentioner til en præcis prompt til en kodeagent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unsupported shortcut: %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ikke-understøttet genvej: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vara heard nothing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vara hørte ikke noget"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vara hears your words — hold the key, speak, let go.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vara hører dine ord — hold tasten, tal, slip."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vara hit a snag": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vara stødte på et problem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vara is forging the text …": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vara smeder teksten …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vara is listening …": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vara lytter …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vara is named after Vár — the goddess who hears oaths and promises.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vara er opkaldt efter Vár — gudinden der hører eder og løfter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vara is ready.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vara er klar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vara needs to hear you": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vara skal kunne høre dig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vara records from macOS' default input device — change the microphone in System Settings → Sound. What happens to the text is decided by the selected mode.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vara optager fra macOS' standard-inputenhed — skift mikrofon i Systemindstillinger → Lyd. Hvad der sker med teksten, afgøres af den valgte tilstand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VibeCode": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VibeCode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you dictate into one of these apps, Vara switches to that mode automatically — e.g. VibeCode in your editor and Professional in Mail. A 1–9 press still wins. The app list shows currently running apps.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Når du dikterer i en af disse apps, skifter Vara automatisk til den tilstand — fx VibeCode i din editor og Professionel i Mail. Et tryk på 1–9 vinder stadig. App-listen viser apps, der kører lige nu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words today": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ord i dag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I går"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your dictations land here so you can copy or reinsert them later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dine dikteringer lander her, så du kan kopiere eller genindsætte dem senere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "words": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ord"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is holding secure keyboard input (e.g. a password field), so macOS blocks the dictation key everywhere. Close the password prompt or quit that app to release it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” holder secure keyboard input (fx et adgangskodefelt), så macOS blokerer dikteringstasten overalt. Luk adgangskodeprompten, eller afslut appen, for at frigive det."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“App default” uses the model chosen under Intelligence.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Appens standard” bruger modellen valgt under Intelligens."
          }
        }
      }
    }
